# DUSKLING M9, BUBBLE SHAFT (room 9): swimming up the bubble shaft and out at the top.
# Played from its way in with plain button presses (LEFT is the D-pad
# side, A the button side), found once by the route finder (cheat solve).
game duskling
wait 5
cheat room 9
hold A 5
hold LEFT+A 16
hold A 12
hold LEFT+A 2
hold A 32
hold LEFT+A 16
hold A 12
hold LEFT+A 2
hold A 32
hold LEFT+A 16
hold A 12
hold LEFT+A 2
hold A 27
hold LEFT 5
hold LEFT+A 7
hold LEFT 29
hold LEFT+A 16
hold LEFT 12
hold LEFT+A 2
wait 3
hold A 29
hold LEFT+A 16
hold A 12
hold LEFT+A 2
hold A 29
wait 2
hold A 10
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 15
hold LEFT 3
wait 2
expect room == 10

